{"level":30,"time":1778514682279,"pid":81613,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BfFuMqF8H1WuAismQzJdH5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI have completed the evaluation of all 39 checklist items in grouping **13 (Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements)**, but unfortunately **all items must be classified as \"not-verifiable\"** due to missing project documentation.\n\n### Why This Review Cannot Proceed\n\nThe project data infrastructure has encountered a critical failure. The project directory exists at `/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/` but contains no accessible documentation:\n\n1. **System Error**: The logs show a database schema error: `\"Failed to fetch project: column project.site_plan_number does not exist\"`\n\n2. **Missing Core Documents**:\n   - `README.md` (master sheet index) - **NOT FOUND**\n   - `facts.md` (project facts and site characteristics) - **NOT FOUND**\n   - Primary site plan sheets - **NOT FOUND**\n   - Supplementary documents - **NOT FOUND**\n\n3. **Missing Evidence Types** Needed for EL-13 Review:\n   - Site plan showing transformer pad locations and dimensions\n   - Utility plan showing underground and overhead infrastructure\n   - Electrical plan showing service specifications\n   - Landscape plan with species identification\n   - Building elevations and cross-sections\n   - Grading and drainage plans\n   - Easement exhibits\n   - AE Design approval documents\n\n### Required Actions to Enable Review\n\n1. **Resolve database schema issue** - The system administrator needs to fix the missing `project.site_plan_number` column in the database\n2. **Populate project data** - Once the schema issue is resolved, run the data retrieval process to populate the project directories with:\n   - README.md with sheet index\n   - facts.md with site characteristics  \n   - Primary site plan sheets with guide.md and blocks.md for each sheet\n   - Supplementary documents with overview.md\n\n3. **Re-run this grouping** - Once project data is available, this review can be completed with full compliance assessment\n\n---\n\n**All 39 checklist items in grouping 13 have been documented as \"not-verifiable\" with detailed agent traces explaining the missing documentation requirement for each item.**"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7272,"cache_read_input_tokens":41522,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7272},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48e47dbc-6e69-4dc2-82f2-99b184acf2d0","uuid":"494a65e7-34f9-4386-9576-2084495ee9f3"}
