{"level":30,"time":1778514682281,"pid":81613,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01FNc7c6q7osFAUXt7bMWqdv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FA4YhVhzxaECYYVyRGErZ3","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"13","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.1","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4","UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Transformer locations, building locations, and clearance dimensions cannot be verified without site plan sheets, electrical plans, and project metadata.","agentTrace":{"observation":"The project directory at 63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a contains no site plan files, no README.md/facts.md metadata, and no supplementary documents.","reasoning":"Without site plans, electrical plans, or any project documentation, it is impossible to determine whether transformer pads are proposed or to verify any clearance requirements. The requirement's applicability cannot be assessed.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.2","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Retaining wall locations and transformer pad clearances cannot be verified without site plan and grading plan sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"The project directory contains no site plan, grading, or plan files.","reasoning":"The item's applicability (presence of retaining walls) and compliance cannot be assessed without access to site plan and grading plan sheets.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Fence locations, transformer pad locations, and access door orientation cannot be verified without site plan sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan sheets exist in the project directory.","reasoning":"Assessment of fence clearances requires site plan showing both fence locations and transformer access door orientation, which cannot be determined without plans.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.4","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 2"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Transformer clearances to buildings and fire rating documentation cannot be verified without site plans and architectural specifications.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan sheets or architectural specification documents exist.","reasoning":"Reduced clearance compliance (3 feet vs. 5 feet) requires verification of AE Design approval, fire rating, confined space status, and window clearances - all dependent on unavailable site plans and specs.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.5","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Balcony and overhang locations relative to transformer pads cannot be verified without site plan, building elevations, and cross-sections.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan, building elevation, or cross-section documents exist.","reasoning":"Assessment requires building elevation and site plan showing balcony/overhang locations and transformer pad position, which are unavailable.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Window/door/duct locations, elevations, and transformer specifications cannot be verified without site plan, building elevations, and electrical specifications.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan, building elevation, or electrical specification documents exist.","reasoning":"This requirement depends on proximity of windows/doors to grade level and their lateral separation from transformers, plus identification of oil-filled equipment - none verifiable without plans and specs.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Sidewalk locations and transformer pad clearances cannot be verified without site plan sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan sheets exist in the project.","reasoning":"The presence of sidewalks and transformer pad location relative to sidewalk back-of-line cannot be assessed without site plans.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Stairwell locations and transformer pad placement cannot be verified without site plan and building floor plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan or building floor plan documents exist.","reasoning":"Applicability depends on presence and location of stairwells, which cannot be determined without site and floor plans.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Fire escape locations, transformer pad placement, and equipment specifications (oil-filled vs. dry-type) cannot be verified without site plan, building elevations, and electrical specifications.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan, building elevation, or electrical specification documents exist.","reasoning":"Fire escape clearance compliance requires knowing fire escape locations, transformer pad position, and whether equipment is oil-filled - information unavailable without plans.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Transformer pad location, access door orientation, and clearances to open area or buildings cannot be verified without site plan sheets and electrical plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan or electrical plan sheets exist.","reasoning":"Hot-stick use area clearance requires identification of access door location, direction, and clearances to buildings/open areas - all dependent on unavailable plans.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.11","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Transformer location relative to niches, vaults, enclosed areas, and 15-foot clearance requirements cannot be verified without site plan and building cross-sections.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan or building cross-section documents exist.","reasoning":"Confined space clearance compliance depends on site configuration showing niches/vaults/enclosed areas, which cannot be assessed without plans.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.12","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Fire hydrant locations and transformer pad clearances cannot be verified without site plan sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No site plan sheets exist.","reasoning":"Applicability depends on presence of fire hydrants shown on site plan, which is unavailable.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.13","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4","ECM Appendix F"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Tree species, locations relative to transformer pads, and overhead distribution conductor locations cannot be verified without landscape plan and utility plan sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No landscape plan or utility plan sheets exist.","reasoning":"Utility-compatible tree identification requires landscape plan showing tree species and proximity to transformers and overhead lines - unavailable.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Shrub and vegetation locations relative to transformer access door side cannot be verified without landscape plan sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No landscape plan sheets exist.","reasoning":"Shrub/vegetation clearance compliance depends on landscape plan showing planting locations and transformer access door orientation, which are unavailable.","tools_used":["Bash"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Project site plan data not available. Tree locations relative to underground electric equipment and root barrier detail specifications cannot be verified without landscape plan and detail sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"No landscape plan or detail sheets exist.","reasoning":"Root barrier compliance requires landscape plan showing trees within 20 feet of underground equipment and detail sheets showing 4-foot deep barri