e applicant's submitted documentation, which is unavailable.\n\n### Findings Delivered\n\nThe structured output includes findings for all 47 checklist items with:\n- **Deficiency IDs:** EL-1.1 through EL-1.47\n- **Status:** not-verifiable (all items)\n- **Code Citations:** From the checklist (UCM § 1.10.3, ECM sections, Reviewer Convention, etc.)\n- **Agent Trace:** Observation, reasoning, and tools_used for each item\n- **Comments:** Clear explanation of missing documentation preventing evaluation\n\nThe review is ready for the workflow consolidation step. All items follow the extended review schema with complete agentTrace documentation for per-item attribution and analysis."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8799,"cache_read_input_tokens":55096,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8799},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fe326180-34cb-4909-9447-54beae19d961","uuid":"e07c185a-3b9e-4fee-a8b1-34a74935992d"}
