tain:\n*   Surveyed vertical elevations of overhead electric conductors or poles relative to building heights.\n*   Dimension annotations showing vertical clearances between building roof lines, overhangs, and overhead conductors.\n\nWhile the plan does show the 2D horizontal routing of overhead utility lines (indicated by the \"O.H.U.\" line type in the legend) and locations of power poles, it does not provide the vertical clearance information requested. You would need to locate the specific architectural or utility profile \"elevation\" sheets within the broader site plan set to find those vertical dimension annotations."}]}
