annot be determined from this sheet whether any proposed trees are positioned within 10 feet of a pole. \n\n**Additional Context:**\nWhile specific poles are not shown, an overhead electric line is depicted running horizontally along the bottom boundary of the site, indicated by a dashed line labeled **\"-OHE-\"**. There are proposed Mitigation Trees (labeled with the **\"M\"** symbol) positioned in close proximity to this line, but no supporting poles are marked along it."}]}
