{"level":30,"time":1778516481756,"pid":81613,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017mbYwndMWkSNoh11aLC2Va","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/wip/measure-distance-tool/vv-el-run/2026-04-15/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-03/block-20.md:3. A pre-construction safety meeting is required with Austin Energy 48 hours before commencement of construction. Call Andrew Perez at 512-505-7153 to schedule a tailgate safety meeting. Include Chuck Hendry (ph 505-7151) in the meeting, if cranes are being used during construction. OSHA requires a 20' clearance from energized transmission lines during construction.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02f3e714-877a-4005-af51-2af8f544a8d6","uuid":"84351363-8ed1-4b7b-9d4b-8c362b7ed505","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/wip/measure-distance-tool/vv-el-run/2026-04-15/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-03/block-20.md:3. A pre-construction safety meeting is required with Austin Energy 48 hours before commencement of construction. Call Andrew Perez at 512-505-7153 to schedule a tailgate safety meeting. Include Chuck Hendry (ph 505-7151) in the meeting, if cranes are being used during construction. OSHA requires a 20' clearance from energized transmission lines during construction.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"level":30,"time":1778516485044,"pid":81613,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BeA8qz7As1M41GFs2PXUrE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found the 48-hour requirement, but it's specifically for transmission line safety meetings (Block 20 of Sheet 3). The requirement in EL-1.46 of the grouping is for a more general note about notifying Austin Energy \"at least 48 hours before work begins near high-voltage overhead lines\" per Texas Health & Safety Code.\n\nThe specific transmission note found is:\n\"A pre-construction safety meeting is required with Austin Energy 48 hours before commencement of construction. Call Andrew Perez at 512-505-7153...\"\n\nThis is essentially meeting that requirement for transmission lines, but:\n1. It's specific to transmission facilities\n2. The grouping requirement EL-1.46 asks for a general note that applies to \"when overhead electric lines exist on or adjacent to site and construction activities are proposed\"\n3. There's no similar blanket notification requirement shown for distribution lines\n\nNow let me check the Block 14 from Sheet 3 to see if there are additional electric notes about distribution lines and notifications.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":494,"cache_read_input_tokens":90047,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":494},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02f3e714-877a-4005-af51-2af8f544a8d6","uuid":"a3ce4bb8-425c-4162-917d-314d72b35dfc"}
