{"level":30,"time":1778516631221,"pid":81613,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01G8Ranyt3VH2CVPpyAsaZ2N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have completed the comprehensive evaluation of all 47 checklist items for the overhead electric line clearance grouping (Grouping 1). The structured output has been provided with:\n\n- 47 findings total, one for each checklist item\n- Status breakdown:\n  - 5 FAIL items (EL-1.7, EL-1.8, EL-1.31, EL-1.37)\n  - 13 NOT-VERIFIABLE items (EL-1.1, EL-1.2, EL-1.3, EL-1.6, EL-1.14, EL-1.17, EL-1.18, EL-1.19, EL-1.22, EL-1.23, EL-1.25, EL-1.26, EL-1.27, EL-1.28, EL-1.29, EL-1.30, EL-1.36, EL-1.38, EL-1.39, EL-1.43, EL-1.45, EL-1.46, EL-1.47)\n  - 29 N/A items (remaining items where applicability conditions not met)\n\nThe key findings are:\n1. **No building elevation sheets** (EL-1.7) - Critical deficiency as no surveyed overhead conductor elevations can be verified\n2. **No clearance dimension exhibits** (EL-1.8) - No section or plan view dimensions from outer conductor to building edges\n3. **No mid-span surveyor clearance data** (EL-1.31) - Survey showing pole locations and mid-span clearances missing\n4. **Trees near OHE not documented as utility-compatible** (EL-1.37) - Trees shown within 10 feet of OHE line but specific species near line not identified\n5. **Multiple clearance requirements not verifiable** - EL-1.1, EL-1.2, EL-1.6, EL-1.14, EL-1.17, EL-1.18, EL-1.19, EL-1.43, etc. due to missing dimension annotations\n\n\n6. The evaluation is now complete and the findings have been documented.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13441,"cache_read_input_tokens":94392,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13441},